Note on the price data
----------------------

This license covers the source code in this repository.

The files under dates/ are a historical Bitcoin price series. From 2010-07-18
onward it is Coin Metrics' PriceUSD reference rate, retrieved from their
community API; the months before that come from a published historical series.
Those providers' own terms govern that data; this license does not grant
rights to it and does not claim any. Check with the original provider before
redistributing the series in bulk or building a competing data product on it.
